/* Declares this app as localised for pt-PT.

   The app's UI strings come from bristlenose/locales/*.json at runtime, not
   from .strings tables — this file exists so macOS knows the localisation is
   available at all. Declaring it is what makes AppKit render ITS OWN menus
   (File, Edit, View, Window, Help and every standard item inside them) in
   Apple's reviewed wording rather than English.

   CFBundleName / CFBundleDisplayName are deliberately absent: Bristlenose is
   a product name and does not translate. */
